# Ravencrest CC0 Poly Haven assets (node scripts/ravencrest/fetchPolyhaven.mjs, then
# scripts/ravencrest/slimTextures.py). What the game loads in browsers ships with the site: the
# models and the 1k texture tier. Kept local: the 2k tier (the desktop app falls back to 1k on the
# web build, materials.ts), the raw unpacked ao/rough/disp maps, and the unused HDRIs.
